Package: prolfquatakeoutmissing
Type: Package
Title: Group-Mean Imputation Contrasts Taken Out of prolfqua
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Witold", "Wolski", , "wew@fgcz.ethz.ch",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6468-120X"))
Description: Keeps the group-mean imputation contrasts ('ContrastsMissing')
    and the 'lm_missing' contrast facade that were removed from prolfqua.
    Loading the package registers 'lm_missing' in the prolfqua facade registry,
    so 'prolfqua::build_contrast_analysis(..., method = "lm_missing")' works again.
